 I understood.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
It was Oscar.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
I had set it up years ago,
 when I realized my grant proposals weren't being funded,
 to watch hydroacoustic feeds for ice sounds.
 Many watched them,
 few watched for ice.
 In six years it sent four alerts:
 a blue whale on a bad bearing,
 a seamount venting and twice clock drift.
\end_layout

